@title Journey: two pages, undo a placement, save, reopen, both pages are back
@area Journeys
# Acceptance round 2: a multi-page project survives save and reopen; an undone placement stays undone.
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
key q
wait 4
text circuit breaker
wait 6
click_text "Miniature circuit breaker, 3-pole" Button
wait 6
click 450 200
wait 6
key Escape
expect_scene F1
# At 1366 the Pages panel opens from its button; at 1920 it is docked already.
try click_text Pages #1
wait 8
click_text New
wait 6
click_text Page #1
wait 10
key Escape
key q
wait 4
text contactor
wait 6
click_text "Contactor main contacts, 3-pole" Button
wait 6
click 450 350
wait 6
key Escape
expect_scene K1
shot page2-placed
key ctrl+z
wait 6
shot page2-undone
answer_dialog ~/Documents/KoperCAD/two-pages.kopercad
key ctrl+s
wait 20
expect_file ~/Documents/KoperCAD/two-pages.kopercad 4000
open ~/Documents/KoperCAD/two-pages.kopercad
wait 30
expect_scene F1
shot reopened-page1
check_layout
key ctrl+shift+z
wait 6
shot after-redo
try click_text Pages #1
wait 8
shot pages-after-reopen
